---
// "Begin your project" band shown above the footer on most pages.
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink text-stone">
  <div class="photo absolute inset-0 opacity-40" style="--img:url('/images/cta.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-ink/85 via-ink/75 to-ink/20"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
    <p class="eyebrow text-stone">Let&rsquo;s create something beautiful</p>
    <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-light lg:text-6xl">Begin your project</h2>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn-outline mt-8">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
